      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱钻奇宝是个非常“普通”的赛马娘。\n干劲也很普通，也不像其他的\n巨星赛马娘一样有着绝对要成功的强烈意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fcfcbc7d63c1b335a791da4b93527ca9ebdcc6300bbf4aab80a312bd5f27341",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
