      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在学园里的比赛也已经九连败……\n不过，她蕴藏着能与已经出道的\n强者成田路竞争的潜力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aa69db6eb0256378f2a2d30de3aa27d63542357300334951b5fe083d5b0a084",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
